  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creating Women Leadership for Resilience in Munda Adibasi (Indigenous) Community</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will  - Create enabling environment for improved socioeconomic status of Munda women  - Initiate and implement climate resilience Income Growth Activities (IGA) for socioeconomic stability of Munda women  - Strengthen and settle climate resilience IGA for the socioeconomic stability of Munda women</narrative>
  </description>
